        "$$\n",
        "  \\int_a^b f(x) \\, dx \\approx \\sum_{i=0}^{n-1} \\frac{f(x_i) + f(x_{i+1})}{2} h\n",
        "$$\n",
        "where $x_i = a + i h $ and $ x_{i+1} = a + (i+1) h $."
